    Call for Participation

http://www.hpdc.org/2012/

The organizing committee is delighted to invite you to *HPDC'12*, the=20
/21st International ACM Symposium on High-Performance Parallel and=20
Distributed Computing/, to be held in *Delft, the Netherlands*, which is=20
a historic, picturesque city that is less than one hour away from=20
Amsterdam-Schiphol airport.

HPDC <http://www.hpdc.org> is the premier annual conference on the=20
design, the implementation, the evaluation, and the use of parallel and=20
distributed systems for high-end computing. HPDC is sponsored by=20
SIGARCH, the Special Interest Group on Computer Architecture=20
<http://www.sigarch.org> of the Association for Computing Machinery=20
<http://www.acm.org>.

*HPDC'12* will be held at Delft University of Technology=20
<http://www.tudelft.nl>, with the main conference taking place on *June=20
20-22* (Wednesday to Friday 1 PM), and with affiliated workshops on=20
*June 18-19* (Monday and Tuesday).

Early registration closes on May 25th, so if you plan on attending,=20
please register now at http://www.hpdc.org/2012/registration/.

*Some highlights of the conference:*

